ctor numbers before landing them //why:verify sector numbers before landing them-sonnet //why:fresh reads keep sessions on current knowledge //why:fresh reads beat stale cache always //why:stop para reflex-healing fresh stale-cache quote //why:stop reflex-healing stale-cache quote //why:stop reflex-healing stale-cache and re-like road //why:stop reflex-healing stale-cache re-like road post-compaction //why:stop reflex-healing re-like road fresh quote //why:stop reflex-healing re-like road re-pressed //why:T1 core only never howto suffix variant //why:force dynamic loading first at session start //why:force dynamic loading first session call //why:session loads cache stale skills evidence //why:fresh load prevents stale quote reuse //why:stale cache re-like post-compaction //why:reflex-healing combined with stop report same message enforced //why:any like before compaction is gone re-like required post-compaction //why:will follow force dynamic fresh skill //why:heal and stop report same message enforced //why:fresh skill loading session start two words //why:para1 force dynamic fresh loading session start",
